    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------<br>\u203b The current trailer shows prototype gameplay. Visuals and effects have been improved since then and are still being refined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b English support is currently undecided as the game is still in development.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, the localization system is already implemented.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We will share updates on English support as we get closer to release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Story  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story about the journey of Geranium, a swordswoman who has lost her memory.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the world's magical power fades, mysterious events are occurring everywhere.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Could these phenomena be connected to the cause of her amnesia...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Game System  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a side-scrolling action RPG platformer where you explore various gimmicks and hidden rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own combat style by combining normal attacks, strong attacks, sub-weapons, and magic spells into stylish combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also craft new weapons and items by collecting materials dropped by enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------<br>\u203b The current trailer shows prototype gameplay. Visuals and effects have been improved since then and are still being refined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b English support is currently undecided as the game is still in development.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, the localization system is already implemented.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We will share updates on English support as we get closer to release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Story  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story about the journey of Geranium, a swordswoman who has lost her memory.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the world's magical power fades, mysterious events are occurring everywhere.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Could these phenomena be connected to the cause of her amnesia...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Game System  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a side-scrolling action RPG platformer where you explore various gimmicks and hidden rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own combat style by combining normal attacks, strong attacks, sub-weapons, and magic spells into stylish combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also craft new weapons and items by collecting materials dropped by enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
